      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 Establishment",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Australian Centre for Disease Control is established by this\nsection.\nApplication of the finance law\n(2) For the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the\nPublic Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013):\n(a) the Australian Centre for Disease Control is a listed entity;\nand\n(b) the Director-General is the accountable authority of the\nCentre; and\n(c) the following persons are officials of the Centre:\n(i) the Director-General;\n(ii) the staff referred to in section 18; and\n(d) the purposes of the Centre include:\n(i) the functions of the Centre referred to in section 9; and\n(ii) the functions of the Director-General referred to in\nsection 11.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Australian Centre for Disease Control is established by this\nsection.\nApplication of the finance law\n(2) For the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the\nPublic Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013):\n(a) the Australian Centre for Disease Control is a listed entity;\nand\n(b) the Director-General is the accountable authority of the\nCentre; and\n(c) the following persons are officials of the Centre:\n(i) the Director-General;\n(ii) the staff referred to in section 18; and\n(d) the purposes of the Centre include:\n(i) the functions of the Centre referred to in section 9; and\n(ii) the functions of the Director-General referred to in\nsection 11.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-7-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-7-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b00087821ff0210fe639c043f778fc3716bf5b155c33a19d3d47dfb05c93628b"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 Establishment",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Australian Centre for Disease Control is established by this\nsection.\nApplication of the finance law\n(2) For the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the\nPublic Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013):\n(a) the Australian Centre for Disease Control is a listed entity;\nand\n(b) the Director-General is the accountable authority of the\nCentre; and\n(c) the following persons are officials of the Centre:\n(i) the Director-General;\n(ii) the staff referred to in section 18; and\n(d) the purposes of the Centre include:\n(i) the functions of the Centre referred to in section 9; and\n(ii) the functions of the Director-General referred to in\nsection 11."
    },
    {
