      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.23",
      "values:originalText": "(1) It is the intention of the Parliament that the Director-General, in\nperforming the Director-General’s functions under paragraphs\n11(a) to (jb), must have regard to:\n(a) the need to base public health advice on data and other forms\nof evidence; and\n(b) the need for public trust in public health advice; and\n(c) the need for transparency in the performance of these\nfunctions; and\n(d) the impacts of risks to public health, and the impacts of\nresponses to risks to public health, on particular communities\nand population groups.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) It is the intention of the Parliament that the Director-General, in\nperforming the Director-General’s functions under paragraphs\n11(a) to (jb), must have regard to:\n(a) the need to base public health advice on data and other forms\nof evidence; and\n(b) the need for public trust in public health advice; and\n(c) the need for transparency in the performance of these\nfunctions; and\n(d) the impacts of risks to public health, and the impacts of\nresponses to risks to public health, on particular communities\nand population groups.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-12-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-12-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-12-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3c4db6363bf72559a50a1392826fa86b38f631034b8022da30f8c030a49c000c",
      "skos:note": "Must have regard to specific factors when performing functions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-12",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12 Objectives",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 23,
      "values:originalText": "(1) It is the intention of the Parliament that the Director-General, in\nperforming the Director-General’s functions under paragraphs\n11(a) to (jb), must have regard to:\n(a) the need to base public health advice on data and other forms\nof evidence; and\n(b) the need for public trust in public health advice; and\n(c) the need for transparency in the performance of these\nfunctions; and\n(d) the impacts of risks to public health, and the impacts of\nresponses to risks to public health, on particular communities\nand population groups."
    },
