      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The staff of the Centre must be persons engaged under the Public\nService Act 1999.\n(2) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999:\n(a) the Director-General and the staff of the Centre together\nconstitute a Statutory Agency; and\n(b) the Director-General is the Head of that Statutory Agency.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The staff of the Centre must be persons engaged under the Public\nService Act 1999.\n(2) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999:\n(a) the Director-General and the staff of the Centre together\nconstitute a Statutory Agency; and\n(b) the Director-General is the Head of that Statutory Agency.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
