      "values:originalText": "(1) The Director-General must cause the advice to be published on the\nCentre’s website no later than 30 days after the Director-General\napproves the advice as mentioned in paragraph 20(f).\nNote:\nFor exemptions from the requirement to publish the advice, see\nsection 22.\n(2) Subject to this Division, the published advice must include any\nsupporting information, analysis or reasoning that was used to\nreach the recommendations in the advice.\n(3) If the advice, including any material mentioned in subsection (2), is\na part (the relevant part) of a document that also contains other\nmaterial, subsection (1) applies only to the relevant part."
