    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-1-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "not",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Negative obligation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The Director-General must publish advice under section 21.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Director-General must not publish advice under section 21 if exempt material is present."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal relation between publication and exemption",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The Director-General may publish advice under section 21 during a period when the advice is not exempt material.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Director-General must not publish advice under section 21 if the advice is present during a period when it is exempt material."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-1-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "until",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal relation between exemption and publication",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The Director-General may publish advice under section 21 until the advice is no longer exempt material.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Director-General must not publish advice under section 21 if the advice is present during a period when it is exempt material."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-1-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "if",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Conditional diffusion of information",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "If the Director-General is satisfied that the advice is exempt material, then the Director-General must not publish advice under section 21.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Director-General must not publish advice under section 21 if the advice is present during a period when it is exempt material."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-1-logic-cogai-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "then",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Conditional action based on exemption status",
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "If the Director-General is satisfied that the advice is exempt material, then the Director-General must not publish advice under section 21.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Director-General must not publish advice under section 21 if the advice is present during a period when it is exempt material."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "22(2) Public health advice that is exempt material",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-22-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.30",
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, if the Director-General is satisfied that:\n(a) the advice is exempt material; but\n(b) it is possible for the Director-General to prepare a copy of the\nadvice, modified by deletions, that would not be exempt\nmaterial;\nthe Director-General must:\n(c) prepare a modified copy of the advice as mentioned in\nparagraph (b); and\n(d) cause the modified copy to be published under section 21.\nAnnual report must include reasons for exemption",
      "skos:definition": "(2) However, if the Director-General is satisfied that:\n(a) the advice is exempt material; but\n(b) it is possible for the Director-General to prepare a copy of the\nadvice, modified by deletions, that would not be exempt\nmaterial;\nthe Director-General must:\n(c) prepare a modified copy of the advice as mentioned in\nparagraph (b); and\n(d) cause the modified copy to be published under section 21.\nAnnual report must include reasons for exemption",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-2-logic-deontic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9c5468c65e4bce0ba298312be42c28d73f89ddbc85f7a0e6be46f741cbe5f48e",
      "skos:note": "Prepare a modified copy of public health advice if possible to prepare without exemptions.",
      "dc:description": "Annual report with reasons for exemption"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-22-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22(2) Public health advice that is exempt material",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 30,
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, if the Director-General is satisfied that:\n(a) the advice is exempt material; but\n(b) it is possible for the Director-General to prepare a copy of the\nadvice, modified by deletions, that would not be exempt\nmaterial;\nthe Director-General must:\n(c) prepare a modified copy of the advice as mentioned in\nparagraph (b); and\n(d) cause the modified copy to be published under section 21.\nAnnual report must include reasons for exemption"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-2-norm",
