        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(d) Cause the modified copy to be published under section 21."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "22(3) Public health advice that is exempt material",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-22-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.30",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The annual report prepared by the Director-General and given to\nthe Minister under section 46 of the Public Governance,\nPerformance and Accountability Act 2013 for a period must, for\nany advice that was not published, or was published in modified\nform, under section 21 because of this section during the period,\n\n\nThe Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 2\nPublication of public health advice  Division 5\nSection 23\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025\ninclude the reasons why the advice was not published, or was\npublished in modified form.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The annual report prepared by the Director-General and given to\nthe Minister under section 46 of the Public Governance,\nPerformance and Accountability Act 2013 for a period must, for\nany advice that was not published, or was published in modified\nform, under section 21 because of this section during the period,\n\n\nThe Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 2\nPublication of public health advice  Division 5\nSection 23\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025\ninclude the reasons why the advice was not published, or was\npublished in modified form.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "17d2e0f61ad5aef5f0df6612636b3114d0ec03596a8f341f653bf0bcfd2d3548",
      "skos:note": "Include reasons for not publishing public health advice"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-22-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22(3) Public health advice that is exempt material",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 30,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The annual report prepared by the Director-General and given to\nthe Minister under section 46 of the Public Governance,\nPerformance and Accountability Act 2013 for a period must, for\nany advice that was not published, or was published in modified\nform, under section 21 because of this section during the period,\n\n\nThe Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 2\nPublication of public health advice  Division 5\nSection 23\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025\ninclude the reasons why the advice was not published, or was\npublished in modified form."
    },
    {
