      "cml:conclusionText": "Include reasons"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "22(4) Public health advice that is exempt material",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-22-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.30",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3), it is sufficient for the annual\nreport to specify the subparagraph or subparagraphs of\nparagraph (a) or (b) of the definition of exempt material in\nsection 5 of this Act that applied to the advice, or that paragraph (c)\nof that definition applied.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3), it is sufficient for the annual\nreport to specify the subparagraph or subparagraphs of\nparagraph (a) or (b) of the definition of exempt material in\nsection 5 of this Act that applied to the advice, or that paragraph (c)\nof that definition applied.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cc1b8d789a4277018ccbac61a6e50a0fd6b09cca20101bebb59d786bf1105ef5",
      "skos:note": "Specify subparagraphs of exempt material in annual report"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-22-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22(4) Public health advice that is exempt material",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 30,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3), it is sufficient for the annual\nreport to specify the subparagraph or subparagraphs of\nparagraph (a) or (b) of the definition of exempt material in\nsection 5 of this Act that applied to the advice, or that paragraph (c)\nof that definition applied."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-22-ss-4"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
