      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-23-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23(2) Rules may make provision about publication of public health",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-23-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.31",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), rules made for the purposes of that\nsubsection may do any of the following:\n(a) provide that advice may only be published under section 21\nafter the end of a specified period after the advice was given\n(which must not be longer than the 30-day period mentioned\nin subsection 21(1));\n(b) require the Director-General to inform a recipient of advice\nthat the advice is proposed to be published under section 21;\n(c) provide for consultation that the Director-General must carry\nout before publishing advice under section 21;\n(d) provide for and in relation to procedures for publishing\nadvice under section 21.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), rules made for the purposes of that\nsubsection may do any of the following:\n(a) provide that advice may only be published under section 21\nafter the end of a specified period after the advice was given\n(which must not be longer than the 30-day period mentioned\nin subsection 21(1));\n(b) require the Director-General to inform a recipient of advice\nthat the advice is proposed to be published under section 21;\n(c) provide for consultation that the Director-General must carry\nout before publishing advice under section 21;\n(d) provide for and in relation to procedures for publishing\nadvice under section 21.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-23"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-23-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-23-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cb64f59c21f7f039539f833ab4cc7af7dc7f14d36ac5f412bfa843d2c7634521",
      "skos:note": "Rules may require the Director-General to inform a recipient of advice that is proposed to be published under section 21.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-23-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23(2) Rules may make provision about publication of public health",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 31,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), rules made for the purposes of that\nsubsection may do any of the following:\n(a) provide that advice may only be published under section 21\nafter the end of a specified period after the advice was given\n(which must not be longer than the 30-day period mentioned\nin subsection 21(1));\n(b) require the Director-General to inform a recipient of advice\nthat the advice is proposed to be published under section 21;\n(c) provide for consultation that the Director-General must carry\nout before publishing advice under section 21;\n(d) provide for and in relation to procedures for publishing\nadvice under section 21."
    },
