      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.33",
      "values:originalText": "This Part establishes the Advisory Council of the Australian Centre\nfor Disease Control. The Advisory Council’s function is to provide\nadvice to the Director-General on public health matters and other\nmatters.",
      "skos:definition": "This Part establishes the Advisory Council of the Australian Centre\nfor Disease Control. The Advisory Council’s function is to provide\nadvice to the Director-General on public health matters and other\nmatters.",
