      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-26-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Applicable",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Imposes no duty or obligation on any agent",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "There is no requirement for the establishment of the Advisory Council.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "No action is required."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-27",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "27 Function of the Advisory Council",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-27"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The function of the Advisory Council is to provide advice to the\nDirector-General on the following:\n(a) public health matters;\n(b) the Centre’s strategic direction and priorities;\n(c) any matter that will assist the performance of the\nDirector-General’s functions or duties or the exercise of the\nDirector-General’s powers under:\n(i) this Act; or\n(ii) the Biosecurity Act 2015; or\n(iii) the National Health Security Act 2007; or\n(iv) the National Occupational Respiratory Disease Registry\nAct 2023;\n(d) any other matter on which the Director-General requests, in\nwriting, the Advisory Council to provide advice.\n(2) A request under paragraph (1)(d) is not a legislative instrument.\n\n\nThe Advisory Council of the Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 3\nMembership of the Advisory Council  Division 3\nSection 28\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The function of the Advisory Council is to provide advice to the\nDirector-General on the following:\n(a) public health matters;\n(b) the Centre’s strategic direction and priorities;\n(c) any matter that will assist the performance of the\nDirector-General’s functions or duties or the exercise of the\nDirector-General’s powers under:\n(i) this Act; or\n(ii) the Biosecurity Act 2015; or\n(iii) the National Health Security Act 2007; or\n(iv) the National Occupational Respiratory Disease Registry\nAct 2023;\n(d) any other matter on which the Director-General requests, in\nwriting, the Advisory Council to provide advice.\n(2) A request under paragraph (1)(d) is not a legislative instrument.\n\n\nThe Advisory Council of the Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 3\nMembership of the Advisory Council  Division 3\nSection 28\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-27-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-27-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "22051bbab2e38af936966f1c0851b1727ddf928228a582c530c7d2f6849bd774"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-27",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "27 Function of the Advisory Council",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 34,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The function of the Advisory Council is to provide advice to the\nDirector-General on the following:\n(a) public health matters;\n(b) the Centre’s strategic direction and priorities;\n(c) any matter that will assist the performance of the\nDirector-General’s functions or duties or the exercise of the\nDirector-General’s powers under:\n(i) this Act; or\n(ii) the Biosecurity Act 2015; or\n(iii) the National Health Security Act 2007; or\n(iv) the National Occupational Respiratory Disease Registry\nAct 2023;\n(d) any other matter on which the Director-General requests, in\nwriting, the Advisory Council to provide advice.\n(2) A request under paragraph (1)(d) is not a legislative instrument.\n\n\nThe Advisory Council of the Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 3\nMembership of the Advisory Council  Division 3\nSection 28\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025"
    },
    {
