      "values:originalText": "(1) The function of the Advisory Council is to provide advice to the\nDirector-General on the following:\n(a) public health matters;\n(b) the Centre’s strategic direction and priorities;\n(c) any matter that will assist the performance of the\nDirector-General’s functions or duties or the exercise of the\nDirector-General’s powers under:\n(i) this Act; or\n(ii) the Biosecurity Act 2015; or\n(iii) the National Health Security Act 2007; or\n(iv) the National Occupational Respiratory Disease Registry\nAct 2023;\n(d) any other matter on which the Director-General requests, in\nwriting, the Advisory Council to provide advice."
