      "skos:note": "Each Advisory Council member must be appointed by the Minister on a part-time basis."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-30-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "30(1) Appointment of Advisory Council members",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 35,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Each Advisory Council member (other than the Director-General\nand the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer) is to be appointed\nby the Minister by written instrument, on a part-time basis.\nNote:\nAn appointed member may be reappointed: see section 33AA of the\nActs Interpretation Act 1901."
    },
