      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.35",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister must ensure that at least one appointed member is an\nAboriginal person or a Torres Strait Islander (or both) who has\nexpertise, qualifications or experience in the health needs of\nAboriginal persons or Torres Strait Islanders (or both).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Minister must ensure that at least one appointed member is an\nAboriginal person or a Torres Strait Islander (or both) who has\nexpertise, qualifications or experience in the health needs of\nAboriginal persons or Torres Strait Islanders (or both).",
