      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.36",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Director-General must cause a list of all members of the\nAdvisory Council to be published on the Centre’s website:\n(2) The rules may require or permit specified information (which may\ninclude personal information) about a member to be included in the\nlist.\n\n\nThe Advisory Council of the Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 3\nAdministration  Division 4\nSection 32\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Director-General must cause a list of all members of the\nAdvisory Council to be published on the Centre’s website:\n(2) The rules may require or permit specified information (which may\ninclude personal information) about a member to be included in the\nlist.\n\n\nThe Advisory Council of the Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 3\nAdministration  Division 4\nSection 32\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-31-ss-1"
