      "values:originalText": "(2) The rules may require or permit specified information (which may\ninclude personal information) about a member to be included in the\nlist.\n\n\nThe Advisory Council of the Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 3\nAdministration  Division 4\nSection 32\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The rules may require or permit specified information (which may\ninclude personal information) about a member to be included in the\nlist.\n\n\nThe Advisory Council of the Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 3\nAdministration  Division 4\nSection 32\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025",
