    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-32",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32 Remuneration and allowances",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-32"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.37",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An appointed member of the Advisory Council is to be paid the\nremuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If\nno determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in\noperation, the member is to be paid the remuneration that is\nprescribed by the rules.\n(2) An appointed member of the Advisory Council is to be paid the\nallowances that are prescribed by the rules.\n(3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An appointed member of the Advisory Council is to be paid the\nremuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If\nno determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in\noperation, the member is to be paid the remuneration that is\nprescribed by the rules.\n(2) An appointed member of the Advisory Council is to be paid the\nallowances that are prescribed by the rules.\n(3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-32-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-32-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-32-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "521d1230ab4b8d5776cad8defeb7918e8e5cb57195b36e9f2b9308a7c97f86fe"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-32",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32 Remuneration and allowances",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 37,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An appointed member of the Advisory Council is to be paid the\nremuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If\nno determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in\noperation, the member is to be paid the remuneration that is\nprescribed by the rules.\n(2) An appointed member of the Advisory Council is to be paid the\nallowances that are prescribed by the rules.\n(3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973."
    },
