      "values:originalText": "(1) A member of the Advisory Council (other than the\nDirector-General) must give written notice to the Director-General\nof all interests, pecuniary or otherwise, that the member has or\nacquires and that conflict or could conflict with the proper\nperformance of the member’s duties.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A member of the Advisory Council (other than the\nDirector-General) must give written notice to the Director-General\nof all interests, pecuniary or otherwise, that the member has or\nacquires and that conflict or could conflict with the proper\nperformance of the member’s duties.",
