    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-42",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "42 Designated data service provider",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-42"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.44",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this Act, each of the following is a designated data service\nprovider:\n(a) the Australian Bureau of Statistics;\n(b) the Australian Institute of Health and Welfare;\n(c) any other Australian government entity determined by the\nDirector-General under subsection (2).\n(2) The Director-General may, by legislative instrument, determine for\nthe purposes of paragraph (1)(c) that an Australian government\nentity is an designated data service provider.\n\n\nInformation  Part 4\nInformation-gathering powers  Division 2\nSection 43\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In this Act, each of the following is a designated data service\nprovider:\n(a) the Australian Bureau of Statistics;\n(b) the Australian Institute of Health and Welfare;\n(c) any other Australian government entity determined by the\nDirector-General under subsection (2).\n(2) The Director-General may, by legislative instrument, determine for\nthe purposes of paragraph (1)(c) that an Australian government\nentity is an designated data service provider.\n\n\nInformation  Part 4\nInformation-gathering powers  Division 2\nSection 43\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-42-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-42-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "955089baaa4799ae296fefa8c0c6068f3bcce9aeb10be505e3b62e862d9474f2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-42",
