      "values:originalText": "(2) The Director-General may, by legislative instrument, determine for\nthe purposes of paragraph (1)(c) that an Australian government\nentity is an designated data service provider.\n\n\nInformation  Part 4\nInformation-gathering powers  Division 2\nSection 43\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Director-General may, by legislative instrument, determine for\nthe purposes of paragraph (1)(c) that an Australian government\nentity is an designated data service provider.\n\n\nInformation  Part 4\nInformation-gathering powers  Division 2\nSection 43\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-42"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
