        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-42-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "06e916edf7f1cc98a7aaa3bd76a3ccfd9415456e4c0f7506d75a45a22bb1bf8d",
      "skos:note": "Director-General may determine an Australian government entity as a designated data service provider."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-42-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "42(2) Designated data service provider",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 44,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Director-General may, by legislative instrument, determine for\nthe purposes of paragraph (1)(c) that an Australian government\nentity is an designated data service provider.\n\n\nInformation  Part 4\nInformation-gathering powers  Division 2\nSection 43\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025"
    },
    {
