      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "Applications may be made to the Administrative Review Tribunal\nfor review of decisions of the Director-General under\nsubsection 45(1) to give directions under that subsection.",
      "skos:definition": "Applications may be made to the Administrative Review Tribunal\nfor review of decisions of the Director-General under\nsubsection 45(1) to give directions under that subsection.",
