        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-48-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits failure to comply with direction.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Given a direction under subsection 45(1)",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Civil penalty if not complied."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-48-logic-descriptionlogic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Classify",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Classifies information as required by the Director-General.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The person has the information in a class of information to be given.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Information is classified as required."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-48-logic-alleninterval-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "During",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Penalty applies during failure to comply with direction.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The person fails to comply with the direction.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Penalty applies during this time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-49",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "49 Register of directions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-49"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Director-General must cause to be published on the Centre’s\nwebsite a register of directions given under subsection 45(1).\n(2) The register must include:\n(a) for each direction:\n(i) the reason the direction was given; and\n(ii) any other information prescribed by the rules; and\n(b) any other information prescribed by the rules.\n\n\nInformation  Part 4\nInformation-gathering powers  Division 2\nSection 49\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025\n(3) Without limiting subparagraph (2)(a)(ii) or paragraph (2)(b), the\nrules may:\n(a) require the register to include information relating to the\nrecipients of directions; and\n(b) provide for the form in which the register must be published;\nand\n(c) provide for circumstances in which directions may be\nremoved from the register.\n(4) Despite anything else in this section, the Director-General must\ntake reasonable steps to ensure that the register does not include\nexempt material.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Director-General must cause to be published on the Centre’s\nwebsite a register of directions given under subsection 45(1).\n(2) The register must include:\n(a) for each direction:\n(i) the reason the direction was given; and\n(ii) any other information prescribed by the rules; and\n(b) any other information prescribed by the rules.\n\n\nInformation  Part 4\nInformation-gathering powers  Division 2\nSection 49\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025\n(3) Without limiting subparagraph (2)(a)(ii) or paragraph (2)(b), the\nrules may:\n(a) require the register to include information relating to the\nrecipients of directions; and\n(b) provide for the form in which the register must be published;\nand\n(c) provide for circumstances in which directions may be\nremoved from the register.\n(4) Despite anything else in this section, the Director-General must\ntake reasonable steps to ensure that the register does not include\nexempt material.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-49-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-49-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-49-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-49-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9be16711dd80920e8c9a75ba2ffe23818e83f43d85b6e7300eb198bedbe8295a"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-49",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "49 Register of directions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Director-General must cause to be published on the Centre’s\nwebsite a register of directions given under subsection 45(1).\n(2) The register must include:\n(a) for each direction:\n(i) the reason the direction was given; and\n(ii) any other information prescribed by the rules; and\n(b) any other information prescribed by the rules.\n\n\nInformation  Part 4\nInformation-gathering powers  Division 2\nSection 49\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025\n(3) Without limiting subparagraph (2)(a)(ii) or paragraph (2)(b), the\nrules may:\n(a) require the register to include information relating to the\nrecipients of directions; and\n(b) provide for the form in which the register must be published;\nand\n(c) provide for circumstances in which directions may be\nremoved from the register.\n(4) Despite anything else in this section, the Director-General must\ntake reasonable steps to ensure that the register does not include\nexempt material."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-49-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "49(1) Register of directions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
