      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Without limiting subparagraph (2)(a)(ii) or paragraph (2)(b), the\nrules may:\n(a) require the register to include information relating to the\nrecipients of directions; and\n(b) provide for the form in which the register must be published;\nand\n(c) provide for circumstances in which directions may be\nremoved from the register.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Without limiting subparagraph (2)(a)(ii) or paragraph (2)(b), the\nrules may:\n(a) require the register to include information relating to the\nrecipients of directions; and\n(b) provide for the form in which the register must be published;\nand\n(c) provide for circumstances in which directions may be\nremoved from the register.",
