      "cml:integrityHash": "8eca65146aed29a1f95d657acfe781acf5f20caefddd160a5105d1516da15231",
      "skos:note": "Rules for register of directions",
      "dc:description": "Information relating to recipients of directions, form of publication, and circumstances for removal from the register"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-49-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "49(3) Register of directions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Without limiting subparagraph (2)(a)(ii) or paragraph (2)(b), the\nrules may:\n(a) require the register to include information relating to the\nrecipients of directions; and\n(b) provide for the form in which the register must be published;\nand\n(c) provide for circumstances in which directions may be\nremoved from the register."
