    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-52",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "52 Authorisation—functions, duties and powers under the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-52"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.51",
      "values:originalText": "Biosecurity Act 2015\n(1) A person (the discloser) may use or disclose relevant information\nin the course of or for the purpose of:\n(a) performing a function or duty, or exercising a power, under\nor in connection with the Biosecurity Act 2015; or\n(b) assisting another person to perform a function or duty, or\nexercise a power, under or in connection with the Biosecurity\nAct 2015.\n(2) The disclosure may include protected information if the person to\nwhom the disclosure is made is:",
      "skos:definition": "Biosecurity Act 2015\n(1) A person (the discloser) may use or disclose relevant information\nin the course of or for the purpose of:\n(a) performing a function or duty, or exercising a power, under\nor in connection with the Biosecurity Act 2015; or\n(b) assisting another person to perform a function or duty, or\nexercise a power, under or in connection with the Biosecurity\nAct 2015.\n(2) The disclosure may include protected information if the person to\nwhom the disclosure is made is:",
