    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-53-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53(2) Authorisation—disclosure in the public interest",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 52,
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, the Director-General may only disclose protected\ninformation under subsection (1) if the Director-General certifies\nthat:\n(a) it is in the public interest to do so; and\n(b) the purpose of the disclosure could not be achieved without\ndisclosing the protected information."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-53-ss-2-norm",
