      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.52",
      "values:originalText": "(5) In deciding whether to give a certificate under subsection (2), the\nDirector-General must act in accordance with guidelines (if any)\nprescribed for the purposes of subsection (4).",
      "skos:definition": "(5) In deciding whether to give a certificate under subsection (2), the\nDirector-General must act in accordance with guidelines (if any)\nprescribed for the purposes of subsection (4).",
