      "cof:title": "53(5) Authorisation—disclosure in the public interest",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 52,
      "values:originalText": "(5) In deciding whether to give a certificate under subsection (2), the\nDirector-General must act in accordance with guidelines (if any)\nprescribed for the purposes of subsection (4)."
