      "skos:prefLabel": "54(2) Authorisation—data service providers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-54-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.53",
      "values:originalText": "(2) A designated data service provider, or a person employed or\nengaged by a designated data service provider, may:\n(a) use and disclose relevant information for the purpose of\nproviding data services to the Director-General; and\n(b) disclose to the Director-General any information obtained or\ngenerated in the course of providing data services to the\nDirector-General; and\n(c) use or disclose any information held by the designated data\nservice provider, where the use or disclosure is for the\npurpose of providing data services to the Director-General to\nassist the Director-General in the performance of the\nDirector-General’s functions or duties or the exercise of the\nDirector-General’s powers under any of the following:\n(i) this Act;\n(ii) the Biosecurity Act 2015;\n(iii) the National Health Security Act 2007;",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A designated data service provider, or a person employed or\nengaged by a designated data service provider, may:\n(a) use and disclose relevant information for the purpose of\nproviding data services to the Director-General; and\n(b) disclose to the Director-General any information obtained or\ngenerated in the course of providing data services to the\nDirector-General; and\n(c) use or disclose any information held by the designated data\nservice provider, where the use or disclosure is for the\npurpose of providing data services to the Director-General to\nassist the Director-General in the performance of the\nDirector-General’s functions or duties or the exercise of the\nDirector-General’s powers under any of the following:\n(i) this Act;\n(ii) the Biosecurity Act 2015;\n(iii) the National Health Security Act 2007;",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-54"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-54-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-54-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "38640fb75d018c573f0730435ee9cb84f2e7b439eeeee9f3a4c1c26ae0d200b5",
      "skos:note": "Authorized data service providers and employees may use and disclose information for the purpose of providing data services to the Director-General."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-54-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "54(2) Authorisation—data service providers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 53,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A designated data service provider, or a person employed or\nengaged by a designated data service provider, may:\n(a) use and disclose relevant information for the purpose of\nproviding data services to the Director-General; and\n(b) disclose to the Director-General any information obtained or\ngenerated in the course of providing data services to the\nDirector-General; and\n(c) use or disclose any information held by the designated data\nservice provider, where the use or disclosure is for the\npurpose of providing data services to the Director-General to\nassist the Director-General in the performance of the\nDirector-General’s functions or duties or the exercise of the\nDirector-General’s powers under any of the following:\n(i) this Act;\n(ii) the Biosecurity Act 2015;\n(iii) the National Health Security Act 2007;"
    },
