    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-65-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "65(4) Authorisation—disclosure to prescribed public health entities",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-65-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.56",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The condition in this subsection is satisfied if the prescribed public\nhealth entity has given the Director-General an undertaking, in\nwriting, to use or disclose the relevant information only where the\nuse or disclosure is either:\n(a) all of the following;\n(i) in accordance with the undertaking;\n(ii) in accordance with any principles determined under\nsubsection (6);\n(iii) reasonably necessary to carry out a prescribed public\nhealth activity specified in the undertaking; or\n(b) otherwise authorised by this Part.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The condition in this subsection is satisfied if the prescribed public\nhealth entity has given the Director-General an undertaking, in\nwriting, to use or disclose the relevant information only where the\nuse or disclosure is either:\n(a) all of the following;\n(i) in accordance with the undertaking;\n(ii) in accordance with any principles determined under\nsubsection (6);\n(iii) reasonably necessary to carry out a prescribed public\nhealth activity specified in the undertaking; or\n(b) otherwise authorised by this Part.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-65"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-65-ss-4-norm"
        },
