      "cof:title": "66(2) Authorisation—use or disclosure by prescribed public health",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 58,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The prescribed public health entity, and any person employed or\nengaged by the entity, may use or disclose the information if the\nuse or disclosure is:\n(a) in the course of carrying out a prescribed public health\nactivity specified in the undertaking for the purposes of\nsubparagraph 65(4)(a)(iii); and\n(b) in accordance with the undertaking."
    },
