      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a data sharing declaration must\nspecify the following matters:\n(a) the kinds of information to which the declaration applies;\n(b) the extent (if any) to which the declaration applies to:\n(i) personal information about any person (including a\ndeceased person); or\n(ii) information (including commercially sensitive\ninformation) the disclosure of which could reasonably\nbe expected to found an action by an entity (other than\nthe Commonwealth) for breach of a duty of confidence;\n(c) the entity or class of entities that may collect, use or disclose\nthe information in accordance with the declaration;\n(d) the entity or class of entities that the information may be\ndisclosed to in accordance with the declaration;\n\n\nInformation  Part 4\nAuthorised collection, use and disclosure of relevant information  Division 3\nSection 68\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025\n(e) one or more permitted purposes of the collection, use or\ndisclosure.\nSpecified permitted purposes",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a data sharing declaration must\nspecify the following matters:\n(a) the kinds of information to which the declaration applies;\n(b) the extent (if any) to which the declaration applies to:\n(i) personal information about any person (including a\ndeceased person); or\n(ii) information (including commercially sensitive\ninformation) the disclosure of which could reasonably\nbe expected to found an action by an entity (other than\nthe Commonwealth) for breach of a duty of confidence;\n(c) the entity or class of entities that may collect, use or disclose\nthe information in accordance with the declaration;\n(d) the entity or class of entities that the information may be\ndisclosed to in accordance with the declaration;\n\n\nInformation  Part 4\nAuthorised collection, use and disclosure of relevant information  Division 3\nSection 68\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025\n(e) one or more permitted purposes of the collection, use or\ndisclosure.\nSpecified permitted purposes",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-67"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-67-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-67-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-67-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2f23c98ca806a7b6d7444b2417b1471cee0277bdd8074630e04a23d3e42076f5",
      "skos:note": "Data sharing declaration must specify certain matters.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-67-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "67(2) Director-General may make data sharing declaration",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 58,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a data sharing declaration must\nspecify the following matters:\n(a) the kinds of information to which the declaration applies;\n(b) the extent (if any) to which the declaration applies to:\n(i) personal information about any person (including a\ndeceased person); or\n(ii) information (including commercially sensitive\ninformation) the disclosure of which could reasonably\nbe expected to found an action by an entity (other than\nthe Commonwealth) for breach of a duty of confidence;\n(c) the entity or class of entities that may collect, use or disclose\nthe information in accordance with the declaration;\n(d) the entity or class of entities that the information may be\ndisclosed to in accordance with the declaration;\n\n\nInformation  Part 4\nAuthorised collection, use and disclosure of relevant information  Division 3\nSection 68\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025\n(e) one or more permitted purposes of the collection, use or\ndisclosure.\nSpecified permitted purposes"
    },
