      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.58",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A permitted purpose specified for the purposes of paragraph (2)(e)\nmust be a purpose that is directly related to preventing or reducing\nthe threat to public health mentioned in paragraph (1)(a).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A permitted purpose specified for the purposes of paragraph (2)(e)\nmust be a purpose that is directly related to preventing or reducing\nthe threat to public health mentioned in paragraph (1)(a).",
