      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.58",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Without limiting subsection 33(3A) of the Acts Interpretation Act\n1901, or any other provision of this Act, a data sharing declaration\nmay provide differently for:\n(a) different kinds of information; and\n(b) different entities or classes of entities; and\n(c) different permitted purposes.\nConditions",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Without limiting subsection 33(3A) of the Acts Interpretation Act\n1901, or any other provision of this Act, a data sharing declaration\nmay provide differently for:\n(a) different kinds of information; and\n(b) different entities or classes of entities; and\n(c) different permitted purposes.\nConditions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-67"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
