      "skos:note": "Director-General may make data sharing declaration subject to conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-67-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "67(5) Director-General may make data sharing declaration",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 58,
      "values:originalText": "(5) A data sharing declaration may specify a matter mentioned in\nsubsection (2) subject to conditions.\nDeclaration is a legislative instrument"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-67-ss-5-norm",
