    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-67-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "67(6) Director-General may make data sharing declaration",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-67-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.58",
      "values:originalText": "(6) A data sharing declaration is a legislative instrument, but\nsection 42 (disallowance) of the Legislation Act 2003 does not\napply to the declaration.\n68  When data sharing declarations cease to be in force\nA data sharing declaration ceases to be in force at the earliest of the\nfollowing:\n(a) if a time at which the declaration will cease to be in force is\nspecified in the declaration—at that time;\n(b) the time at which the declaration is repealed;\n(c) the start of the day after the end of the period of 12 months\nbeginning on the day the declaration commences.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) A data sharing declaration is a legislative instrument, but\nsection 42 (disallowance) of the Legislation Act 2003 does not\napply to the declaration.\n68  When data sharing declarations cease to be in force\nA data sharing declaration ceases to be in force at the earliest of the\nfollowing:\n(a) if a time at which the declaration will cease to be in force is\nspecified in the declaration—at that time;\n(b) the time at which the declaration is repealed;\n(c) the start of the day after the end of the period of 12 months\nbeginning on the day the declaration commences.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-67"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-67-ss-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "835e6b6f6c907fee43d1f7e46d0ec1e393c3adc6019d6b2e56084d724909ff2a",
      "skos:note": "Definition of data sharing declaration"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-67-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "67(6) Director-General may make data sharing declaration",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 58,
      "values:originalText": "(6) A data sharing declaration is a legislative instrument, but\nsection 42 (disallowance) of the Legislation Act 2003 does not\napply to the declaration.\n68  When data sharing declarations cease to be in force\nA data sharing declaration ceases to be in force at the earliest of the\nfollowing:\n(a) if a time at which the declaration will cease to be in force is\nspecified in the declaration—at that time;\n(b) the time at which the declaration is repealed;\n(c) the start of the day after the end of the period of 12 months\nbeginning on the day the declaration commences."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-67-ss-6-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-67-ss-6"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-69",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "69 Authorisation—data sharing declarations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-69"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.60",
      "values:originalText": "At any time when a data sharing declaration is in force, an entity\nmay collect, use or disclose information if:\n(a) the collection, use or disclosure is for a permitted purpose\nspecified in the declaration; and\n(b) the information is of a kind specified in the declaration for\nthe purposes of paragraph 67(2)(a); and\n(c) if the information is of a kind mentioned in\nparagraph 67(2)(b)—the declaration applies to the\ninformation; and\n(d) the entity is specified in the declaration, or is in a class of\nentities specified in the declaration, for the purposes of\nparagraph 67(2)(c); and\n(e) in the case of disclosure—the information is disclosed to an\nentity specified in the declaration, or an entity included in a\nclass of entities specified in the declaration, for the purposes\nof paragraph 67(2)(d); and\n(f) if a matter mentioned in paragraph (a), (b), (c), (d) or (e) of\nthis section is specified in the declaration subject to\nconditions—those conditions are satisfied.",
      "skos:definition": "At any time when a data sharing declaration is in force, an entity\nmay collect, use or disclose information if:\n(a) the collection, use or disclosure is for a permitted purpose\nspecified in the declaration; and\n(b) the information is of a kind specified in the declaration for\nthe purposes of paragraph 67(2)(a); and\n(c) if the information is of a kind mentioned in\nparagraph 67(2)(b)—the declaration applies to the\ninformation; and\n(d) the entity is specified in the declaration, or is in a class of\nentities specified in the declaration, for the purposes of\nparagraph 67(2)(c); and\n(e) in the case of disclosure—the information is disclosed to an\nentity specified in the declaration, or an entity included in a\nclass of entities specified in the declaration, for the purposes\nof paragraph 67(2)(d); and\n(f) if a matter mentioned in paragraph (a), (b), (c), (d) or (e) of\nthis section is specified in the declaration subject to\nconditions—those conditions are satisfied.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-69-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-69-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-69-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-69-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-69-logic-descriptionlogic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-69-logic-deontic-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-69-logic-descriptionlogic-6"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b5a86531196e79f0924234c6d51d58f0fade062da949c061d87c2804933e737c",
      "skos:note": "Entities may collect, use or disclose information if specified conditions are met."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-69",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "69 Authorisation—data sharing declarations",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 60,
      "values:originalText": "At any time when a data sharing declaration is in force, an entity\nmay collect, use or disclose information if:\n(a) the collection, use or disclosure is for a permitted purpose\nspecified in the declaration; and\n(b) the information is of a kind specified in the declaration for\nthe purposes of paragraph 67(2)(a); and\n(c) if the information is of a kind mentioned in\nparagraph 67(2)(b)—the declaration applies to the\ninformation; and\n(d) the entity is specified in the declaration, or is in a class of\nentities specified in the declaration, for the purposes of\nparagraph 67(2)(c); and\n(e) in the case of disclosure—the information is disclosed to an\nentity specified in the declaration, or an entity included in a\nclass of entities specified in the declaration, for the purposes\nof paragraph 67(2)(d); and\n(f) if a matter mentioned in paragraph (a), (b), (c), (d) or (e) of\nthis section is specified in the declaration subject to\nconditions—those conditions are satisfied."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-69-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-69"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
