      },
      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.66",
      "values:originalText": "This Part contains provisions about enforcement. In particular, this\nPart provides for how civil penalty provisions in this Act are\nenforceable under the Regulatory Powers Act.\n\n\nEnforcement  Part 5\nCivil penalties  Division 2\nSection 74\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025",
      "skos:definition": "This Part contains provisions about enforcement. In particular, this\nPart provides for how civil penalty provisions in this Act are\nenforceable under the Regulatory Powers Act.\n\n\nEnforcement  Part 5\nCivil penalties  Division 2\nSection 74\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-73-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bb587ea7131207f2ad2494b2cae798eb446d9ca47fa35978b9586c66b679923e",
      "skos:note": "Part provides for how civil penalty provisions in this Act are enforceable under the Regulatory Powers Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025#sec-73",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "73 Simplified outline of this Part",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 66,
      "values:originalText": "This Part contains provisions about enforcement. In particular, this\nPart provides for how civil penalty provisions in this Act are\nenforceable under the Regulatory Powers Act.\n\n\nEnforcement  Part 5\nCivil penalties  Division 2\nSection 74\nNo. 61, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025"
    },
