      "dc:source": "australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025.pdf, p.71",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make rules\nprescribing matters:\n(a) required or permitted by this Act to be prescribed; or\n(b) necessary or convenient to be prescribed for carrying out or\ngiving effect to this Act.",
